[PendlePrincipalToken::_redeemPT()](https://github.com/sherlock-audit/2024-06-leveraged-vaults/blob/main/leveraged-vaults-private/contracts/vaults/staking/protocols/PendlePrincipalToken.sol#L124-L138)
